// Title: family 4's one-hop mutation (`widen_through_let`) never survives
// the per-family cap when the body has TM_CAP (3) direct consumer sites.
// Command:
//   graphix-fuzz typemorph-one /abs/path/verdict.txt 5000 < fuzz-mutate-hop-starved.gx
//   grep widen-consumer /abs/path/verdict.txt
// Expected: a widen-consumer probe at a `let` statement (site 1 for `w` or
//   3 for `s`: the hop).
// Observed: REJECT widen-consumer#8, #4, #14 only (the three direct
//   operators); dropping the last line's array leaves `w + 1` alone and
//   the hop (widen-consumer#1) appears.
{
  let w = i64:5;
  let s = w + i64:1;
  [s * i64:2, s - i64:3, s / i64:4]
}
